alt=\"Map of the RMP region\" style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border:0;\">\n        <\u002Fbutton>\n        <p style=\"font-size:10.5px; color:#8b8b8b; margin-top:7px; line-height:1.45;\">Adams, Arapahoe, Broomfield &amp; Jefferson counties, Colorado.<\u002Fp>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fnav>\n    <sc-if value=\"{{ isTablePage }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\">\n    <nav class=\"rmp-sidebar rmp-nav\" style=\"position:sticky; top:168px; align-self:flex-start; flex:none; width:258px; max-height:calc(100vh - 188px); overflow-y:auto; padding-right:22px; border-right:1px solid #E1DACC;\">\n      <div style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#8b8b8b; padding:0 12px 8px;\">Progress table<\u002Fdiv>\n      <a href=\"#progress-table\">Full Progress Table<\u002Fa>\n      <a href=\"#ttbl-g1\">Educational Foundations<\u002Fa>\n      <a href=\"#ttbl-g2\">Enrollment in Training / Education<\u002Fa>\n      <a href=\"#ttbl-g3\">Skill &amp; Credential Attainment<\u002Fa>\n      <a href=\"#ttbl-g4\">Employment at a Good Wage<\u002Fa>\n      <a href=\"#ttbl-g5\">Build Generational Wealth<\u002Fa>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:22px; padding-top:16px; border-top:1px solid #E1DACC;\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:8px; margin-bottom:8px;\">\n          <span style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:10.5px; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#8b8b8b;\">The RMP Region<\u002Fspan>\n          <button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ openMap }}\" title=\"Expand map\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10.5px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer; border:1px solid #E1DACC; background:#fff; color:#58585a; border-radius:6px; padding:3px 7px;\">⤢ Expand<\u002Fbutton>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n        <button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ openMap }}\" title=\"Expand map\" style=\"display:block; width:100%; padding:0; border:1px solid #E1DACC; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; background:#fff; cursor:pointer;\">\n          <img src=\"caacc363-75f4-4d5e-a1a9-d2f5bcc9a639\" alt=\"Map of the RMP region\" style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border:0;\">\n        <\u002Fbutton>\n        <p style=\"font-size:10.5px; color:#8b8b8b; margin-top:7px; line-height:1.45;\">Adams, Arapahoe, Broomfield &amp; Jefferson counties, Colorado.<\u002Fp>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fnav>\n    <\u002Fsc-if>\n    <div style=\"flex:1; min-width:0;\">\n    <sc-if value=\"{{ isOverview }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ true }}\">\n    <div id=\"overview\" style=\"max-width:820px; scroll-margin-top:156px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:12.5px; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#B23F7C; margin-bottom:14px;\">RMP Cradle to Career Outcome Metrics<\u002Fdiv>\n      <h1 style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:900; font-size:44px; line-height:1.05; letter-spacing:-.02em; color:#2C2820; text-wrap:balance;\">Understanding the Current State of Cradle to Career Success in the North Metro Region<\u002Fh1>\n      <p style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.55; color:#58585a; margin-top:18px; max-width:660px;\">Where the Rocky Mountain Partnership region stands on every Cradle to Career outcome metric, and what each trend means for reaching our <strong style=\"color:#2C2820;\">2030-31 goal of helping 71,142 more young people in meeting Cradle to Career milestones<\u002Fstrong>. Explore each metric below, or jump to the full progress table.<\u002Fp>\n      <p style=\"margin-top:16px; background:#FBFAF5; border:1px solid #E7E1D5; border-left:3px solid #3F9CA3; border-radius:12px; padding:15px 18px; font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#58585a;\">Why cradle to career outcomes? And how do we measure these? Click <a href=\"https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/19c563fe09124c73a8bf3d8b67043146/page/Milestones-and-Metrics-for-Success\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">HERE<\u002Fa> to learn more.<\u002Fp>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n\n    <section style=\"margin-top:34px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr)); gap:14px;\">\n      <div style=\"background:#58585a; color:#F1EEE4; border-radius:18px; padding:26px 26px 24px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#8b8b8b;\">Our Current State<\u002Fdiv>\n        <div style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:900; font-size:46px; line-height:1; margin-top:12px; color:#EE9322;\">~105K<\u002Fdiv>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#D8D2C4; margin-top:12px;\">young people up to age 35 are not meeting Cradle to Career milestones in the RMP Region<\u002Fp>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"background:#3F9CA3; color:#fff; border-radius:18px; padding:26px 26px 24px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#D5EBEC;\">Our 2030-31 Goal<\u002Fdiv>\n        <div style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:900; font-size:46px; line-height:1; margin-top:12px;\">~71,142<\u002Fdiv>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#E7F3F3; margin-top:12px;\">more young people up to age 35 are meeting Cradle to Career milestones in the RMP Region by 2030<\u002Fp>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"background:#B23F7C; color:#fff; border-radius:18px; padding:26px 26px 24px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#F0D3E2;\">Our 2025-26 Goal<\u002Fdiv>\n        <div style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:900; font-size:46px; line-height:1; margin-top:12px;\">~5,808<\u002Fdiv>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#F6E5EE; margin-top:12px;\">more young people up to age 35 are meeting Cradle to Career milestones in the RMP Region this upcoming school year<\u002Fp>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fsection>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-top:16px; background:#FBFAF5; border:1px solid #E7E1D5; border-left:3px solid #B23F7C; border-radius:12px; padding:15px 18px; font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#58585a;\">In alignment with the national StriveTogether® network, this effort is part of a larger movement to help 4 million young people across the U.S. achieve economic mobility by 2030. Click <a href=\"https://rmpartnership.org/vision-and-mission/our-approach/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">HERE<\u002Fa> to learn more.<\u002Fp>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-top:16px; background:#FBFAF5; border:1px solid #E7E1D5; border-left:3px solid #3F9CA3; border-radius:12px; padding:15px 18px; font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#58585a;\">What industries are the biggest drivers of the economy, and what role do they play in cradle to career success? Click <a href=\"https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/19c563fe09124c73a8bf3d8b67043146/page/ABOUT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">HERE<\u002Fa> to learn more.<\u002Fp>\n\n    <section id=\"goal-progress\" style=\"margin-top:22px; scroll-margin-top:156px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:18px;\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:22px; letter-spacing:-.01em; color:#2C2820;\">71K Goal Progress<\u002Fh2>\n        <button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ copyGoalLink }}\" title=\"Copy a link to this section\" style=\"flex:none; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer; border:1px solid #E1DACC; background:#fff; color:#58585a; border-radius:7px; padding:4px 9px;\">{{ goalLinkLabel }}<\u002Fbutton>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <p style=\"font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.6; color:#58585a; max-width:900px; margin:2px 4px;\">To reach our regional target, 71,142 young people need support to meet key milestones. We recruit Target Champions and stand up High Impact Projects committed to supporting twice that number, over 142,000 young people, to account for variability in impact and ensure we meet this number.<\u002Fp>\n\n      <div style=\"background:#fff; border:1px solid #E7E1D5; border-radius:18px; padding:24px 28px 24px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:16px; line-height:1.35; color:#2C2820; letter-spacing:-.01em; max-width:820px;\">Committed to Date <span style=\"font-weight:500; color:#58585a;\">— Target Champions and High Impact Projects (HIPs) have committed to help more young people get back on track, but we still need more commitments to help close the gap.<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n        <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:stretch; gap:2px; margin-top:22px; height:40px;\">\n          <div class=\"therm-seg\" style=\"flex:3.2; background:#3F9CA3; border-radius:5px 2px 2px 5px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:15px; color:#fff;\">62,549<\u002Fspan><div class=\"therm-tip\"><strong>Committed to Date<\u002Fstrong><br>62,549<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div class=\"therm-seg\" style=\"flex:1; background:#B8B8B9;\"><div class=\"therm-tip\"><strong>+75,504<\u002Fstrong><br>+12,955 from previous<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div class=\"therm-seg\" style=\"flex:1; background:#888889;\"><div class=\"therm-tip\"><strong>+106,480<\u002Fstrong><br>+30,976 from previous<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div class=\"therm-seg\" style=\"flex:1; background:#58585A; border-radius:2px 5px 5px 2px;\"><div class=\"therm-tip\"><strong>+142,284<\u002Fstrong><br>+35,804 from previous<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n        <div style=\"display:flex; gap:2px; margin-top:8px;\">\n          <div style=\"flex:3.2;\"><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"flex:1; text-align:right; font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:13px; color:#58585a;\">+75,504<\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"flex:1; text-align:right; font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:13px; color:#58585a;\">+106,480<\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"flex:1; text-align:right; font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:13px; color:#58585a;\">+142,284<\u002Fdiv>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n        <div style=\"display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:8px 14px; margin-top:18px; font-size:12px; color:#58585a;\">\n          <span style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;\"><span style=\"width:12px; height:12px; border-radius:3px; background:#3F9CA3;\"><\u002Fspan>Committed to Date<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:4px;\">\n            <span style=\"width:12px; height:12px; border-radius:3px; background:#B8B8B9;\"><\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"width:12px; height:12px; border-radius:3px; background:#888889;\"><\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"width:12px; height:12px; border-radius:3px; background:#919193;\"><\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"width:12px; height:12px; border-radius:3px; background:#58585A;\"><\u002Fspan>\n          <\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;\">Still Needed<\u002Fspan>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 4px; background:#FBFAF5; border:1px solid #E7E1D5; border-left:3px solid #3F9CA3; border-radius:12px; padding:15px 18px; font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#58585a;\">What progress has been made towards these commitments so far? View Target Champion progress <a href=\"https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/19c563fe09124c73a8bf3d8b67043146/page/TARGET-CHAMPIONS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">HERE<\u002Fa> and High Impact Projects <a href=\"https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/19c563fe09124c73a8bf3d8b67043146/page/HIGH-IMPACT-PROJECTS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">HERE<\u002Fa>.<\u002Fp>\n\n      <div style=\"background:#fff; border:1px solid #E7E1D5; border-radius:18px; padding:24px 28px 24px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:16px; line-height:1.35; color:#2C2820; letter-spacing:-.01em; max-width:820px;\">Regional Progress Towards 71K More <span style=\"font-weight:500; color:#58585a;\">(This bar will fill up like a thermometer as more young people get back on track each year through 2030–2031)<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n        <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:stretch; gap:3px; margin-top:22px; height:40px;\">\n          <div class=\"therm-seg\" style=\"flex:0.42; background:#3F9CA3; border-radius:6px 3px 3px 6px;\"><div class=\"therm-tip\"><strong>Progress to Date<\u002Fstrong><br>+516<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div class=\"therm-seg\" style=\"flex:1; background:#E8E8E9;\"><div class=\"therm-tip\"><strong>Year 2 (2025-2026)<\u002Fstrong><br>+6,324 &nbsp;·&nbsp; +5,808 from previous<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div class=\"therm-seg\" style=\"flex:1; background:#CBCBCC;\"><div class=\"therm-tip\"><strong>Year 3 (2026-2027)<\u002Fstrong><br>+14,552 &nbsp;·&nbsp; +8,228 from previous<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div class=\"therm-seg\" style=\"flex:1; background:#AEAEB0;\"><div class=\"therm-tip\"><strong>Year 4 (2027-2028)<\u002Fstrong><br>+25,200 &nbsp;·&nbsp; +10,648 from previous<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div class=\"therm-seg\" style=\"flex:1; background:#919193;\"><div class=\"therm-tip\"><strong>Year 5 (2028-2029)<\u002Fstrong><br>+38,268 &nbsp;·&nbsp; +13,068 from previous<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div class=\"therm-seg\" style=\"flex:1; background:#757577;\"><div class=\"therm-tip\"><strong>Year 6 (2029-2030)<\u002Fstrong><br>+53,750 &nbsp;·&nbsp; +15,482 from previous<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div class=\"therm-seg\" style=\"flex:1; background:#58585A; border-radius:3px 6px 6px 3px;\"><div class=\"therm-tip\"><strong>Year 7 (2030-2031)<\u002Fstrong><br>+71,142 &nbsp;·&nbsp; +17,392 from previous<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n        <div style=\"display:flex; gap:3px; margin-top:8px;\">\n          <div style=\"flex:0.42; font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:13px; color:#2E7A80;\">+516<\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"flex:1; text-align:right; font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:13px; color:#58585a;\">+6,324<\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"flex:1; text-align:right; font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:13px; color:#58585a;\">+14,552<\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"flex:1; text-align:right; font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:13px; color:#58585a;\">+25,200<\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"flex:1; text-align:right; font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:13px; color:#58585a;\">+38,268<\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"flex:1; text-align:right; font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:13px; color:#58585a;\">+53,750<\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"flex:1; text-align:right; font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:13px; color:#58585a;\">+71,142<\u002Fdiv>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n        <div style=\"display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px 18px; margin-top:18px; font-size:12px; color:#58585a;\">\n          <span style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;\"><span style=\"width:12px; height:12px; border-radius:3px; background:#3F9CA3;\"><\u002Fspan>Progress to Date<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;\"><span style=\"width:12px; height:12px; border-radius:3px; background:#E8E8E9;\"><\u002Fspan>Year 2 (2025-2026)<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;\"><span style=\"width:12px; height:12px; border-radius:3px; background:#CBCBCC;\"><\u002Fspan>Year 3 (2026-2027)<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;\"><span style=\"width:12px; height:12px; border-radius:3px; background:#AEAEB0;\"><\u002Fspan>Year 4 (2027-2028)<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;\"><span style=\"width:12px; height:12px; border-radius:3px; background:#919193;\"><\u002Fspan>Year 5 (2028-2029)<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;\"><span style=\"width:12px; height:12px; border-radius:3px; background:#757577;\"><\u002Fspan>Year 6 (2029-2030)<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;\"><span style=\"width:12px; height:12px; border-radius:3px; background:#58585A;\"><\u002Fspan>Year 7 (2030-2031)<\u002Fspan>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n\n      <p style=\"font-size:12.5px; font-style:italic; line-height:1.55; color:#8b8b8b; max-width:900px; margin:2px 4px;\">Please note: These figures reflect the number of additional young people meeting cradle-to-career milestones beyond what would be expected from the natural trend (a.k.a. where the data would have gone if no additonal effort was made. This is NOT the total number of young people meeting milestones. The reason we look at data this way is that it helps isolate the impact of the intentional action being taken in this region.<\u002Fp>\n\n      <p style=\"font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.6; color:#58585a; max-width:900px; margin:2px 4px;\">This bar reflects overall regional progress toward cradle-to-career milestones. Because the most recent data is only available for a few outcomes, the bar is slower to populate. Growth is occurring where Target Champions are active, but lags in data and challenges in other areas of the region mean the overall regional picture looks incomplete for now.<\u002Fp>\n\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 4px; background:#FBFAF5; border:1px solid #E7E1D5; border-left:3px solid #3F9CA3; border-radius:12px; padding:15px 18px; font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#58585a;\">What action is being taken to reach the 71K goal? Learn more about Target Champions <a href=\"https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/19c563fe09124c73a8bf3d8b67043146/page/TARGET-CHAMPIONS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">HERE<\u002Fa>, High Impact Projects <a href=\"https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/19c563fe09124c73a8bf3d8b67043146/page/HIGH-IMPACT-PROJECTS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">HERE<\u002Fa>, and Policy and Civic Leadership <a href=\"https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/19c563fe09124c73a8bf3d8b67043146/page/POLICY-%26-CIVIC-LEADERSHIP\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">HERE<\u002Fa>.<\u002Fp>\n\n      <div style=\"background:#fff; border:1px solid #E7E1D5; border-radius:18px; padding:24px 28px 24px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:16px; line-height:1.35; color:#2C2820; letter-spacing:-.01em; max-width:820px;\">Target Champions’ Direct Impact on Cradle to Career Outcomes <span style=\"font-weight:500; color:#58585a;\">(This bar will fill up like a thermometer as more young people get back on track each year through 2030–2031)<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n        <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:stretch; gap:3px; margin-top:22px; height:40px;\">\n          <div class=\"therm-seg\" style=\"flex:1.1; background:#EE9322; border-radius:6px 3px 3px 6px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:14px; color:#fff;\">5,122<\u002Fspan><div class=\"therm-tip\"><strong>Estimated Direct C2C Impact<\u002Fstrong><br>+5,122 to date<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div class=\"therm-seg\" style=\"flex:1; background:#E8E8E9;\"><div class=\"therm-tip\"><strong>Year 2 (2025-2026)<\u002Fstrong><br>+8,413 &nbsp;·&nbsp; +3,291 from previous<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div class=\"therm-seg\" style=\"flex:1; background:#CBCBCC;\"><div class=\"therm-tip\"><strong>Year 3 (2026-2027)<\u002Fstrong><br>+15,954 &nbsp;·&nbsp; +7,541 from previous<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div class=\"therm-seg\" style=\"flex:1; background:#AEAEB0;\"><div class=\"therm-tip\"><strong>Year 4 (2027-2028)<\u002Fstrong><br>+24,155 &nbsp;·&nbsp; +8,201 from previous<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div class=\"therm-seg\" style=\"flex:1; background:#919193;\"><div class=\"therm-tip\"><strong>Year 5 (2028-2029)<\u002Fstrong><br>+33,231 &nbsp;·&nbsp; +9,076 from previous<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div class=\"therm-seg\" style=\"flex:1; background:#757577;\"><div class=\"therm-tip\"><strong>Year 6 (2029-2030)<\u002Fstrong><br>+42,503 &nbsp;·&nbsp; +9,272 from previous<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div class=\"therm-seg\" style=\"flex:1; background:#58585A; border-radius:3px 6px 6px 3px;\"><div class=\"therm-tip\"><strong>Year 7 (2030-2031)<\u002Fstrong><br>+52,359 &nbsp;·&nbsp; +9,856 from previous<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n        <div style=\"display:flex; gap:3px; margin-top:8px;\">\n          <div style=\"flex:1.1;\"><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"flex:1; text-align:right; font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:13px; color:#58585a;\">+8,413<\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"flex:1; text-align:right; font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:13px; color:#58585a;\">+15,954<\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"flex:1; text-align:right; font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:13px; color:#58585a;\">+24,155<\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"flex:1; text-align:right; font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:13px; color:#58585a;\">+33,231<\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"flex:1; text-align:right; font-family:'Archivo',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:13px; color:#58585a;\">+42,503<\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"flex:1; text-align:right; font-family:'Archivo'